# =====================================================================
# Release V051 -- Email/Phone Details Rate scoped to ACTIVE patients
# =====================================================================
# The rates read ~24% because the numerator (patients WITH contact -- only active have it,
# inactive have contact removed) was divided by ALL 27,748 patients. Over the ACTIVE base they're
# ~94% email / ~100% phone. Fix: denominator = active patients (both metrics), numerators
# active-scoped too. In Fact_Metric_Actuals the email/phone rate section now sums an active_count
# for the Denominator instead of Patient_Count.
#
# Card impact is immediate: the Email/Phone cards read '_Metric Actuals' (dRate = Num/Den), so a
# rebuild + model refresh corrects them with NO Tabular Editor re-run. (The matching fix in
# TabularEditor_Patients.csx is the live oracle, for compare-mode consistency only.)
#
# AFTER deploy: Orchestrate_Build (Fact_Metric_Actuals rebuilds every run) + model refresh.
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V051__contact_rate_active_scope.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Gold.usp_Load_Fact_Metric_Actuals.StoredProcedure.sql

TEST
